                 MOVE MAE-SUBPRO                    TO ADS-SUBPRO          00037
                 MOVE MAE-FESOLIC                   TO ADS-FEFIVALI
                                                       ADS-FECOVALI
                 PERFORM 232200-LEER-UGDTADS
              END-IF
      *
              MOVE WS-CODTIAMO                     TO WS-TIPO-CUOTA.
