                 MOVE ADE-FEFIVALI            TO WS-FEFIVALI
                 MOVE ADE-PERINT              TO WS-PERINT
                 MOVE ADE-CARECAP             TO WS-CARECAP
                 MOVE ADE-CAREINT             TO WS-CAREINT
                 MOVE ADE-CODTIAMO            TO WS-CODTIAMO
                 MOVE ADE-PROGGEOM            TO WS-PROGGEOM
