                 MOVE ADE-LININCUO            TO WS-LININCUO
                 MOVE ADE-TIPODIAS            TO WS-TIPODIAS
                 MOVE ADE-DIASCAL             TO WS-DIASCAL
                 MOVE ADE-UGYFARET            TO WS-UGYFARET
                 MOVE ADE-INDINANT            TO WS-INDINANT

              ELSE                                                          0003
                 IF DB2-NOTFND AND SQLWARN0 = SPACES                        0003
                    MOVE 'UGE0939'               TO CAA-COD-ERROR           0003
                    MOVE 'NO HAY REGISTRO EN'    TO CAA-VAR1-ERROR          0003
                    MOVE 'UGDTADE '              TO CAA-VAR2-ERROR          0003
                    PERFORM 300000-FINAL                                    0003
                 ELSE                                                       0003
                    MOVE 'UGE0939'               TO CAA-COD-ERROR           0003
                    MOVE 'SELECT UGDTADE'        TO CAA-VAR1-ERROR          0003
                    MOVE 'COD ERROR: '           TO CAA-VAR2-ERROR(1:12)    0003
                    MOVE DB2-RETURN-CDE          TO CAA-VAR2-ERROR(13:)     0003
