      ******************************************************************
       241000-VALIDA-CUOTA.
      *
              IF SW-CRED-ANTERIOR = 'N'
      *COL01-I
                 SET SI-VALANT       TO  TRUE
      *COL01-F
                 PERFORM 241100-VALIDA-CUOTA-CRED-ANT
                 SET SI-CRED-ANT              TO TRUE
      *COL01-I
