                 IF WS-CUOTA-VIG > WS-CUOTA-ANT
                     MOVE 'S'                      TO S039-INDSCOR
                                                      WS-IND-MARCA1
                 ELSE
                     MOVE 'N'                      TO S039-INDSCOR
                                                      WS-IND-MARCA1
                 END-IF
              END-IF.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      *               241100-VALIDA-CUOTA-CRED-ANT
      ******************************************************************
       241100-VALIDA-CUOTA-CRED-ANT.
      *
              PERFORM 241120-CALCULO-CUOTA-ANT
              MOVE  WS-PRICUOTA                   TO WS-CUOTA-ANT.
