                    MOVE 'ERROR UGDTT37'        TO CAA-VAR1-ERROR
                    MOVE 'SQLCODE '             TO CAA-VAR2-ERROR(1:8)
                    MOVE DB2-RETURN-CDE         TO CAA-VAR2-ERROR(9:)
                    PERFORM 300000-FINAL
